.DS_Store
.capture.log
.capture-transcript.tmp
.capture-extractor.tmp

# Regenerable local output — genuinely never wanted in either repo.
transcript-extractor/parsed/
*.egg-info/

# ── NOT ignored ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The design docs, product notes, operating files and session records are all
# TRACKED, and they all go to the private remote (automemory-logs). They are
# excluded from the public remote at PUSH time by a filter, not by ignoring.
#
# Ignoring them here was wrong: .gitignore applies to every remote, so ignoring
# them would have made them unreachable from the private repo too — "keep it out
# of public" silently became "delete it".
#
# To publish a rinsed tree to the public repo, see `rinse` in CLAUDE.md / the
# project's release notes: clone to a temp dir, filter, force-push.